description:
Barely one month after getting our new station vehicle, a deer came up out of a deep ditch and darted in front of a semi tractor-trailer and then crossed right in front of me. I came out of it pretty good, but the car was mess. Bumper cover, both fenders, windshield and roof were all damage.  Glass shards were everywhere inside the car and even jamming buttons for on/off & hazard lights, probably others.


